   districts (Aadhaar, Passport Seva Kendra, RTO, Taluk, CSC, bank, hospital,
   police, agriculture, employment exchange, municipal).
3. Each scheme includes multilingual name/description (English/Hindi/Tamil),
   eligibility JSON, required documents, estimated processing days, and tags.

## Security
No policy changes. These tables already allow SELECT to authenticated users.
